{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05092","headline":"嵩山石淙侍宴应制 · 沈佺期","name":"嵩山石淙侍宴应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"金舆旦下绿云衢，彩殿晴临碧涧隅。\n溪水泠泠杂行漏，山烟片片绕香炉。\n仙人六膳调神鼎，玉女三浆捧帝壶。\n自惜汾阳纡道驾，无如太室览真图。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"沈佺期","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05092.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05092","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}